<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Booking Confirmation</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #4CAF50;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
    }
    .header h2 {
      margin: 0;
    }
    .content {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-top: none;
    }
    .info-box {
      background-color: #e8f5e9;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .info-box strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .info-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    }
    .info-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .info-label {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #555;
    }
    .info-value {
      color: #333;
    }
    .badge-pending {
      background-color: #FF9800;
      color: white;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
    }
    .property-image {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 200px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Booking Confirmation</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello {{guestName}},</p>
      <p>Thank you for your booking request! We have received your request and it is currently <strong>pending approval</strong> from the property owner.</p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <strong>Your Booking Details</strong>
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Booking Number:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{bookingNumber}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Status:</span>
          <span class="info-value"><span class="badge-pending">Pending Approval</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Property:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{propertyName}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Address:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{propertyAddress}}, {{propertyCity}}, {{propertyState}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Check-in:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{checkInDate}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Check-out:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{checkOutDate}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Total Nights:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{totalNights}} nights</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Total Amount:</span>
          <span class="info-value">${{totalAmount}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Payment Method:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{paymentMethod}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #666;">
        <strong>What's Next?</strong><br>
        You will receive a confirmation email once the property owner approves your booking.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666;">
        If you have any questions, please contact the property owner directly.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{currentYear}} Property Management. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>